There is a patch that adds an autoopen option, similar to the
autopickup option, that when the option is enabled and the player moves
in the direction of a closed door, it tries to open it.  It doesn't
start kicking locked doors, which IMO is actually a good thing, kicking
doors down angers shopkeepers & guards, so you want to be more careful
with that.

You can get the patch here:
http://www.argon.org/~roderick/nethack/nethack-3.4.1-sbusti-autoopen-patchable.diff



